			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Rebuild compiled output after RouteManifest regeneration\n\nRegenerate RouteManifest timestamp and rebuild all Target/ artifacts including JS bundles and source maps. This is a routine rebuild pass to synchronize compiled output with the regenerated RouteManifest manifest.\n\nMountain method count remains at 142 — no new RPC methods were added in this pass.",
